# .gitignore
# Keeps secrets, personal tooling files and build output out of the repository.
# Rule of thumb: if a file holds credentials, personal data or machine-specific state, it is listed here.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration (never commit these)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.der
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
credentials
credentials.*
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets/
.aws/
.npmrc
.netrc

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal tool and assistant settings (machine paths, local permissions)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
.playwright-mcp/
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
.fleet/
.history/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating system files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Java and Maven (api/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
target/
*.class
*.log
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
.mvn/wrapper/maven-wrapper.jar
# The jar serves the built SPA; the copy is produced by the build, not committed.
api/src/main/resources/static/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Node, Vite and Playwright (web/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AWS CDK (infra/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cdk.out/
# The app avoids context lookups, so there is nothing to cache; ignoring the file
# also guarantees that account IDs never reach the repository.
cdk.context.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local databases, dumps and scratch output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.backup
tmp/
